{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">ROUND function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310540","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/ROUND-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/ROUND-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"ROUND-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">ROUND function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Rounds a decimal expression to a specified\nnumber of places after the decimal point.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ROUND-function__syntax_GC1A16F2702862\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d497718e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"ROUND-function__idGDO2WR2676114\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>ROUND ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">precision</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A decimal expression.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">precision</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A non-negative integer expression whose value is the number\nof places you want in the decimal result of the ROUND function.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ROUND-function__example_GC1A16G2702869\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d497718e155\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure increases all <code class=\"ph codeph\">CreditLimit</code> values by 10\npercent, rounding those values to the nearest $100:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-round.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"ROUND-function__idGDO2WS2676121\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>FOR EACH Customer:\n  DISPLAY Customer.CustNum Customer.Name Customer.CreditLimit.\n  Customer.CreditLimit = <strong class=\"ph b\">ROUND((Customer.CreditLimit * 1.1) / 100 ,0)</strong> * 100.\n  PAUSE.\n  DISPLAY Customer.CreditLimit.\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ROUND-function__see-also_GC1A16H2702877\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d497718e196\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TRUNCATE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TRUNCATE-function.html#TRUNCATE-function\">TRUNCATE function</a>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RIGHT-TRIM-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RIGHT-TRIM-function.html\">RIGHT-TRIM function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ROUTINE-LEVEL-ON-ERROR-UNDO-THROW-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ROUTINE-LEVEL-ON-ERROR-UNDO-THROW-statement.html\">ROUTINE-LEVEL ON ERROR UNDO, THROW statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310540","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"ROUND function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ROUND-function.html","type":"Manual"}